  "body": "This generously sized brand-new home (approx. 360sqm of floor area) delivers the perfect balance of sophisticated style and relaxed coastal living—just moments from Long Bay Beach, local shops, and schools. Thoughtfully designed for modern family life, it offers an exceptional blend of comfort, practicality, and understated elegance.\r\n\r\nBehind the striking façade lies a meticulously crafted family haven with space and quality at every turn. Featuring six double bedrooms and 4.5 bathrooms—including three master en-suites—this home ensures privacy and convenience for the whole family. Four separate living areas provide versatile zones for entertaining, relaxation, or quality time together, while the modern kitchen and secondary kitchenette cater effortlessly to everything from weekday meals to large-scale hosting.\r\n\r\nVersatile living options: The private downstairs area features a master en-suite bedroom, a living area, and its own separate entrance—ideal for grandparents, extended family, guests, or teenagers wanting greater independence. It also offers flexibility for those considering additional accommodation or potential rental income opportunities.\r\n\r\nDesigned to capture all-day sun, the layout embraces indoor-outdoor living at its finest. The open-plan family room, dining area, and kitchen flow seamlessly onto a spacious deck—perfect for alfresco dining or simply soaking in the peaceful surroundings. Bathed in natural light and warmth, every room feels inviting and uplifting.\r\n\r\nMore than just a house, this is a beautifully considered home for those seeking space, style, and convenience. Set on a sun-drenched freehold section, this striking property is your gateway to a fabulous new lifestyle in sought-after Long Bay.",
